━━━ stdout
Serve the language server for editors

The server is the analysis engine that pip install opentide installs: KQL, SPL, ES|QL, EQL, Kibana KQL, Lucene, Falco, CQL, YARA, Exabeam, YARA-L, Datadog and Tide YAML. The editor owns the process and speaks the protocol on stdio. On the command line, opentide validate and opentide lint report what it finds.

Usage: opentide lsp <COMMAND>

Commands:
  start  Serve LSP on stdio until the editor closes stdin

Options:
      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide lsp start

